    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "about",
      "label": "About Us",
      "title": "About Us",
      "sub": "Integrated Forging Base · Since 2003",
      "lede": "A special steel producer with melting, refining, remelting, forging and heat treatment under one roof. 66,000 m² of forging base, 600 people, and a 110 kV substation sized for heavy forging.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "kv",
          "items": [
            {
              "n": "66,000 m²",
              "d": "Forging base, Fujian"
            },
            {
              "n": "5,000 t",
              "d": "Hydraulic press"
            },
            {
              "n": "600",
              "d": "Employees"
            },
            {
              "n": "110 kV",
              "d": "Dedicated substation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "paras": [
            "Founded in 2003, the plant runs a complete route from electric-arc melting through LF/VD refining, ESR remelting, forging, heat treatment and machining. Because every step is in-house, one purchase order covers the whole chain — there is no outsourced weak link to trace when a heat is questioned.",
            "We supply tool steel and alloy structural steel as forged bars, flats, plates, blocks and modules, black, peeled, milled or six-face machined. Each heat is traceable from melt to dispatch."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "photo",
          "fill": true,
          "src": "images/ph-hero.svg",
          "cap": "5,000 t forging press, Fujian plant"
        }
      ]
    },
